  DisplayName: Molthuni Mercenary
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Prerequisite Region - Eye of Dread Whether you sought citizenship
    or simply needed a steady paycheck, you spent some of your time as a paid mercenary
    in the armed forces of Molthune, where you fought against Molthune's enemies
    such as Nirmathas or the Ironfang Legion. Alternatively, you might have worked
    at sea, protecting Molthune's military and trading ships against pirates on Lake
    Encarthan. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Constitution
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Athletics skill and
    the Mercenary Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Experienced
    Professional] skill feat.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens World Guide
